 delivered in batches to any number of destinations.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"role":"collection","title":"Trackers","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","kind":"symbol"},"doc://LifecycleTracking/documentation/LifecycleTracking":{"title":"LifecycleTracking","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking","type":"topic","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/lifecycletracking","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Track the app’s installs, updates, opens, moves to the background and terminations, and make the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s records durable as the app leaves the foreground."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Checksums/documentation/Checksums":{"title":"Checksums","identifier":"doc:\/\/Checksums\/documentation\/Checksums","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The CRC-32 checksum of raw bytes, as zlib, PNG, gzip and Ethernet compute it."}],"url":"\/documentation\/checksums"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/AutomaticTracking":{"role":"article","title":"Automatic Tracking","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Track screen views, control activations and the app’s lifecycle without a call at each place they happen."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/AutomaticTracking","url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/automatictracking","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/TrackingPlanWorkflow":{"role":"article","title":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tell the people and services that read your events what each event holds, and 